0 // Source: /mnt/d/pdf预览/3+套圈圈搭建说明_pdf, 11 local JPGs.
0 // Four 24x24 plates form a 48x48 court; 46 red 2x4 bricks tile its 2-stud border.
0 // Sixteen 4x4 pedestals use five interlocked 48-LDU courses.
0 // Print faces point +Z; animal columns sit on the front two stud rows.
0 // Inferred from perspective: regular 12-stud pedestal pitch and 6-stud center inset.
0 // Source has no loose throwing rings; none are added to this source reconstruction.
